{"candidateAnswer":"After witnessing a family struggling on the streets, Maria reached out to the shelter and asked if they needed volunteers, and they said yes.","evidence":"[D27:4 | 6:20 pm on 3 August, 2023] Maria: I started volunteering here about a year ago after witnessing a family struggling on the streets. It made me want to help, so I reached out to the shelter and asked if they needed any volunteers. They said yes, and it has been a really fulfilling experience for me since then.","itemId":"urn:uuid:61d8388f-f53d-5923-823f-efc1bcd2938b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a9a98a7ace3abe32586a5003feeab51116828d3bc8cb8cbedbe207196219b50e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How did Maria start volunteering at the homeless shelter?","referenceAnswer":"Witnessed a family struggling on the streets and reached out to the shelter","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a9a98a7ace3abe32586a5003feeab51116828d3bc8cb8cbedbe207196219b50e"}}]}